{"nodes": [{"id": "apps_demo_stack_readme_demo_yigini", "label": "@maestro/demo-stack", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "apps/demo-stack/README.md", "source_location": "apps/demo-stack", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Studio'yu tek komutla ger\u00e7ek veriyle \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r halde g\u00f6steren geli\u015ftirme y\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 (pnpm demo:up \u2192 Studio 7000, BFF 7001)."}, {"id": "apps_demo_stack_readme_veri_sahte_davranis_degil", "label": "Veri sahte, davran\u0131\u015f sahte de\u011fil", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "apps/demo-stack/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Aya\u011fa kalkan BFF apps/bff'in buildServer()'\u0131n\u0131n ta kendisi: ayn\u0131 rotalar, authGuard, rol kontrolleri, proje kapsam\u0131, decideGate yolu, fail-closed kontroller. De\u011fi\u015fen tek \u015fey portlar\u0131n alt\u0131ndaki katman. Kimlik do\u011frulama, yetkilendirme, kap\u0131 kararlar\u0131, veri s\u0131n\u0131f\u0131 filtresi ve fail-closed u\u00e7lar GER\u00c7EKTEN \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131yor; demo'nun Jira s\u0131rr\u0131 olmad\u0131\u011f\u0131 i\u00e7in verifyWebhook REDDEDER, 'tamam' demez."}, {"id": "apps_demo_stack_readme_bos_sayfa_baglama_karari", "label": "Bellek-i\u00e7i read model ba\u011flama karar\u0131n\u0131n ba\u011flama duyarl\u0131l\u0131\u011f\u0131", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "apps/demo-stack/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "apps/deploy/src/stores/read-models.ts tam tersini yap\u0131yor ve do\u011fru: ger\u00e7ek bir kuruluma bakan composition root'un 'ko\u015fu yok' demesi sakin bir Cuma'dan ay\u0131rt edilemez. Demo'da store tohumlu ve s\u00fcre\u00e7 kendini demo ilan ediyor, o y\u00fczden bo\u015f sayfa yalan de\u011fil hata olurdu. Ayn\u0131 kod, farkl\u0131 ba\u011flam, ters do\u011fru karar."}, {"id": "apps_demo_stack_readme_yol_oneki_uyusmazligi", "label": "Studio /runs vs BFF /studio/runs yol \u00f6neki uyu\u015fmazl\u0131\u011f\u0131", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "apps/demo-stack/README.md", "source_location": "apps/studio/src/screens/shared/runs.ts:113,130", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "evidence ve detail'in journal sekmesi veri olmad\u0131\u011f\u0131 i\u00e7in de\u011fil, YOL \u00d6NEK\u0130 UYU\u015eMADI\u011eI i\u00e7in bo\u015f: Studio /runs/:ticket/journal \u00e7a\u011f\u0131r\u0131yor, BFF /studio/ \u00f6neki alt\u0131nda sunuyor ve ikisi de tohumlanm\u0131\u015f durumda. Studio'da tek kelimelik bir \u00f6nek d\u00fczeltmesi iki ekran\u0131 an\u0131nda canland\u0131r\u0131r."}, {"id": "apps_demo_stack_readme_demo_hesaplari", "label": "Demo hesaplar\u0131 ve rol matrisi", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "apps/demo-stack/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Yedi hesap, her biri bir rol\u00fcn ne g\u00f6rebildi\u011fini g\u00f6steriyor (admin, tech-lead, product-owner, qa, developer, viewer, internal-audit). Parolalar a\u00e7\u0131k\u00e7a yaz\u0131l\u0131: yerel geli\u015ftirme kimlik bilgisi s\u0131r de\u011fildir ve giri\u015f bilgisi bulunamayan bir demo kimsenin \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131ramayaca\u011f\u0131 bir demodur; yine de bcrypt'ten ve ger\u00e7ek parola politikas\u0131ndan ge\u00e7iyorlar."}], "edges": [{"source": "apps_demo_stack_readme_demo_hesaplari", "target": "apps_bff_rapor_kalan_uclar_internal_audit_rolu_yok", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 0.9, "source_file": "apps/demo-stack/README.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "apps_demo_stack_readme_demo_yigini", "target": "apps_demo_stack_readme_veri_sahte_davranis_degil", "relation": "references", "c